  "limits": "The corpus is a generated test corpus with DOM-derived ground truth (bench/generate.py, reproducible from a fixed seed). The detector was not tuned on this corpus's per-screen values; the same team wrote the generator, so results describe the value formats and layouts listed above rather than every possible desktop. Concurrent CPU inference excludes queue wait; resumed samples retain their original measured timestamps."
